        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo kuyoozwa batumwa kulindime mumaato kuyoocenjezya ba-Kusi bakede cakuliiba, lino bayooyabangana cakupenga mubuzuba obo bwa-Egepita, nkaambo buzuba bwasika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
