                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Bona! Ndi sinkondonyina Farao mwami wa-Egepita. Njootyola maboko aakwe oonse, nkukuti kuboko kucili kuyumu akooko ikwakatyokede, nkabela ipanga njooliwisya kuzwa mujanza lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
