          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela njooyumya maboko aamwami wa-Babuloni akubika ipanga lyangu mujanza lyakwe, pele maboko aa-Farao njooatyola, nkabela uyootongela kubusyu bwakwe mbubonya mbwatongela muntu uuyasidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
