        {
          "text": "Njooyumya maboko aamwami wa-Babuloni, pele maboko aa-Farao ayoolebuluka. Lino bayooziba kuti ndime Jehova ninzoobika ipanga lyangu mujanza lyamwami wa-Babuloni kuti alitandabike anyika ya-Egepita. ",
